/Title (Optimize Digital Platforms for Budget Devices: Ensure that the telecom operator's official mobile app, website, and digital portals are lightweight and fully optimized for lower-end specifications. They should load fast, consume less RAM, and function smoothly on affordable hardware. Tailor Affordable Digital Products: Since budget smartphone users are typically price-sensitive, focus on promoting cost-effective internet packs, daily/weekly micro-bundles, and cheap social media data tokens \(e.g., specific packs for Facebook, YouTube, or TikTok\). Device Bundling Partnerships: Collaborate with popular budget smartphone brands \(such as Xiaomi, Realme, or Infinix\) to offer co-branded devices bundled with free or discounted data plans. This can attract a high volume of new subscribers looking for maximum value.)
